WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.975
Step three pretends the sys-admin
group were kept by the org chart.

2
00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:08.152
It loads the kit's module, reads
Contoso sequel admins from the fixture,

3
00:00:08.152 --> 00:00:10.412
and marks its membership as org-chart.

4
00:00:10.412 --> 00:00:13.825
The map now sorts it as
pattern one, a dynamic group.

5
00:00:13.825 --> 00:00:16.075
The group has no organization codes,

6
00:00:16.075 --> 00:00:19.975
so the target says to ask H R for
the code rather than write a rule.

7
00:00:19.975 --> 00:00:23.863
But the flag is what matters: a
privileged role on a dynamic group.

8
00:00:23.863 --> 00:00:26.225
Use an assigned group under pim instead.

9
00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:28.630
A privileged role never sits on a rule.
